WEBVTT

00:02:56.866 --> 00:03:00.017
If there are infinite ways
for our bodies to look,

00:03:00.041 --> 00:03:01.692
our minds to think,

00:03:01.716 --> 00:03:03.605
personalities to act,

00:03:03.629 --> 00:03:06.121
wouldn't it make sense
that there's that much variety

00:03:06.145 --> 00:03:07.678
in biological sex, too?

00:03:10.141 --> 00:03:14.093
Did you know that besides
XX or XY chromosomes,

00:03:14.117 --> 00:03:17.799
you could have XX and XY chromosomes?

00:03:17.823 --> 00:03:20.284
Or you could have an extra X -- XXY.

00:03:20.308 --> 00:03:22.394
Or two extra -- XXXY.

00:03:22.854 --> 00:03:24.062
Goes on from there.

00:03:24.086 --> 00:03:26.773
And for those "normal"
people with XX or XY,

00:03:26.797 --> 00:03:27.950
what does that mean?

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.077
I have XY chromosomes.